  "sn22.5:1.7": "As the following discussion shows, “origination” means, not the simple arising of phenomena, but the cause of their arising. This point has important implications for the establishing of mindfulness. See <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn22'>DN 22</a>. For an alternative description of the origination of the aggregates, see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn22.56'>SN 22:56–57</a>.",
